    <briefdescription>
<para>A simple stopwatch utility for measuring elapsed time. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classastrea_1_1utilities_1_1StopWatch" kindref="compound">StopWatch</ref> class provides a convenient way to measure elapsed time in seconds. It uses the high-resolution clock from the &lt;chrono&gt; library to provide accurate timing. </para>
